---
import Base from '../layouts/Base.astro';
---
<Base
  title="Terms & Conditions"
  description="Review guest terms and sanctuary hospitality guidelines for The Elite Spa Centre in Kalyani Nagar, Pune."
>
  <main class="pt-36 pb-24 sm:pt-44 sm:pb-28 max-w-3xl mx-auto px-5 sm:px-8 space-y-8">
    <h1 class="font-serif text-[44px] sm:text-[56px] text-[#F5F5F0]">Terms &amp; Conditions</h1>
    <div class="space-y-5 text-[18px] text-[#F5F5F0]/90 leading-[1.65]">
      <p>Signature 60-minute therapies start at ₹999, with optional 30-minute extensions at +₹400 per block. Couples rituals start at ₹1,999 per couple and express reflexology rituals start at ₹699.</p>
      <p>All rituals at The Elite Spa Centre are professional, restorative wellness services delivered with full respect for guest comfort, consent, and hospitality standards.</p>
      <p>For rescheduling or custom late-night bookings between 10:00 PM and 3:00 AM, please message our concierge directly on WhatsApp at +91 91995 61258.</p>
    </div>
  </main>
</Base>
